{"id":"c5e95ffb1173","path":"/en/university/info/llm/externals/alumni","lang":"en","title":"Courses for USI Alumni and Swiss Universities Students","description":"The Laboratory of Modern Languages - USI's language centre - offers pre-semester and semester-time language courses during the Autumn and Spring semesters. Subject to availability, all language courses are generally open to USI Alumni and students from other Swiss universities…","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Info","LLM","External users"],"image":null,"words":260,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/llm/esterni/alumni","en":"/en/university/info/llm/externals/alumni"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Info","path":"/en/originalnode/14049"},{"label":"LLM","path":null},{"label":"External users","path":null},{"label":"Courses for USI Alumni and Swiss Universities Students","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>The <a href=\"/en/universita/info/llm\">Laboratory of Modern Languages</a> - USI's language centre - offers pre-semester and semester-time language courses during the Autumn and Spring semesters.</p> <p>Subject to availability, all language courses are generally open to USI Alumni and students from other Swiss universities upon payment of the applicable course fee (see information below).</p> <p><strong>Registration details can be found in the accordion below.</strong></p> <p><strong>Course offerings</strong></p> <p><strong>Italian, French, German ane English language courses</strong> - intensive pre-semester and semester-time - for all levels, <strong>with the exception of level B2 part 2 courses:</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://www.desk.usi.ch/en/italian-courses?_gl=1*13kw8ko*_gcl_au*MTg1MDA4NTIzNi4xNzgzOTQ1ODgw*_ga*ODU4OTkwMDI1LjE2NzUzMjUyMDM.*_ga_89Y0EEKVWP*czE3ODU5NDUyNTIkbzUwNyRnMSR0MTc4NTk0NjE0MiRqNyRsMCRoMTk3NTQ2ODk4NA..\">Italian language courses</a>; <a href=\"https://www.desk.usi.ch/en/italian-language-courses-faq?_gl=1*12kksuc*_gcl_au*MTcxOTAyMzA0Ni4xNzgyMTEzODMzLjY4MDUxMjU3MS4xNzgyODk1ODUwLjE3ODI4OTU4NTA.*_ga*MTM3OTk1NzQ4NS4xNzc0MjU4NDc0*_ga_89Y0EEKVWP*czE3ODI4ODk0OTgkbzEwNiRnMSR0MTc4Mjg5NjYyMCRqMjEkbDAkaDE4MTE2NTgxNzU.\">Frequently Asked Questions</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://www.desk.usi.ch/en/french-language-courses?_gl=1*130pz3k*_gcl_au*MTg1MDA4NTIzNi4xNzgzOTQ1ODgw*_ga*ODU4OTkwMDI1LjE2NzUzMjUyMDM.*_ga_89Y0EEKVWP*czE3ODU5NDUyNTIkbzUwNyRnMSR0MTc4NTk0NjE3NyRqNTQkbDAkaDE5NzU0Njg5ODQ.\">French language courses</a>; <a href=\"https://www.desk.usi.ch/en/french-language-courses-faq?_gl=1*8fut6u*_gcl_au*MTcxOTAyMzA0Ni4xNzgyMTEzODMzLjY4MDUxMjU3MS4xNzgyODk1ODUwLjE3ODI4OTU4NTA.*_ga*MTM3OTk1NzQ4NS4xNzc0MjU4NDc0*_ga_89Y0EEKVWP*czE3ODI4ODk0OTgkbzEwNiRnMSR0MTc4Mjg5NjY1MiRqNjAkbDAkaDE4MTE2NTgxNzU.\">Frequently Asked Questions</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://www.desk.usi.ch/en/german-language-courses?_gl=1*1eokhhu*_gcl_au*MTg1MDA4NTIzNi4xNzgzOTQ1ODgw*_ga*ODU4OTkwMDI1LjE2NzUzMjUyMDM.*_ga_89Y0EEKVWP*czE3ODU5NDUyNTIkbzUwNyRnMSR0MTc4NTk0NjIxNSRqMTYkbDAkaDE5NzU0Njg5ODQ.\">German language courses</a>; <a href=\"https://www.desk.usi.ch/en/german-language-courses-faq?_gl=1*4j1e4h*_gcl_au*MTcxOTAyMzA0Ni4xNzgyMTEzODMzLjY4MDUxMjU3MS4xNzgyODk1ODUwLjE3ODI4OTU4NTA.*_ga*MTM3OTk1NzQ4NS4xNzc0MjU4NDc0*_ga_89Y0EEKVWP*czE3ODI4ODk0OTgkbzEwNiRnMSR0MTc4Mjg5NjU4NiRqNTUkbDAkaDE4MTE2NTgxNzU.\">Frequently Asked Questions</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://www.desk.usi.ch/en/english-language-courses-lugano-campuses?_gl=1*1cw2kk9*_gcl_au*MTg1MDA4NTIzNi4xNzgzOTQ1ODgw*_ga*ODU4OTkwMDI1LjE2NzUzMjUyMDM.*_ga_89Y0EEKVWP*czE3ODU5NDUyNTIkbzUwNyRnMSR0MTc4NTk0NjI1MCRqNTQkbDAkaDE5NzU0Njg5ODQ.\">English language courses</a>; <a href=\"https://www.desk.usi.ch/en/english-language-courses-faq\">Frequently Asked Questions</a></li> </ul> <p> <strong>Exam preparation courses</strong> for internationally recognized language certifications:</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/courses/35279123/b2-consolidamento-e-preparazione-delf?_gl=1%2A1qjsgi5%2A_gcl_au%2AMTcxOTAyMzA0Ni4xNzgyMTEzODMz%2A_ga%2AMTM3OTk1NzQ4NS4xNzc0MjU4NDc0%2A_ga_89Y0EEKVWP%2AczE3ODI4ODk0OTgkbzEwNiRnMSR0MTc4Mjg5NTgwOSRqMjYkbDAkaDE4MTE2NTgxNzU.\">Preparing for B2 DELF</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/courses/35279111/corso-preparazione-goethe-qcer-c1?_gl=1%2Abu03pg%2A_gcl_au%2AMTcxOTAyMzA0Ni4xNzgyMTEzODMzLjY4MDUxMjU3MS4xNzgyODk1ODUwLjE3ODI4OTU4NTA.%2A_ga%2AMTM3OTk1NzQ4NS4xNzc0MjU4NDc0%2A_ga_89Y0EEKVWP%2AczE3ODI4ODk0OTgkbzEwNiRnMSR0MTc4Mjg5NjA4MSRqNjAkbDAkaDE4MTE2NTgxNzU.\">Preparing for C1 Goethe-Zertifikat</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/courses/35279135/preparazione-ielts-b2-c1-intensivo\">Preparing for IELTS B2/C1</a></li> </ul> <p> <strong>Ancient languages</strong>: the <a href=\"https://www.ftl.usi.ch/it\">Faculty of Theology of Lugano</a> offers courses in <a href=\"https://www.desk.usi.ch/en/ancient-language-courses?_gl=1*yu4fsu*_gcl_au*MTcxOTAyMzA0Ni4xNzgyMTEzODMzLjY4MDUxMjU3MS4xNzgyODk1ODUwLjE3ODI4OTU4NTA.*_ga*MTM3OTk1NzQ4NS4xNzc0MjU4NDc0*_ga_89Y0EEKVWP*czE3ODI4ODk0OTgkbzEwNiRnMSR0MTc4Mjg5NjQ4NyRqNTgkbDAkaDE4MTE2NTgxNzU.\">ancient languages</a> as part of its academic programs.</p> <p><strong>Fees</strong></p> <table> <tbody> <tr> <td><strong>Course format</strong></td> <td><strong>Fees</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Pre-semester intensive courses (60 hrs)</td> <td>CHF 800</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Semester-time courses (28+28 hrs)</td> <td>CHF 500</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Semester-time courses (56 hrs)</td> <td>CHF 800</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Pre-semester courses in preparation for<br> official certifications (60 hrs)</td> <td>CHF 1'500</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Semester-time courses in preparation for<br> official certifications (28+28 hrs)</td> <td>CHF 850</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><strong>Payment Methods</strong></p> <p>The invoice will be sent by mail to the address provided during the registration (only after the course level has been confirmed, following the successful completion of the entrance test). The invoice is due within thirty days from the date of issuance. The total amount must be paid via bank or postal transfer. For further information, please contact: <a href=\"mailto:external.language.services@usi.ch\">external.language.services@usi.ch</a></p>"},{"t":"accordion","items":[{"title":"Registration for language courses","html":"<p><a href=\"https://usi.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_eFfZGh8yaOdyh14\">Enrolment Autumn semester - Intensive pre-semester &amp; semester-time courses</a></p> <p><a href=\"https://usi.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_cVon3BhvZpESyHA\">Enrolment Spring semester - Intensive pre-semester &amp; semester-time courses </a></p>"}]}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Laboratory of Modern Languages","href":"/en/universita/info/llm"},{"label":"Administrative team","href":"/en/university/info/llm/administration/administrative-team"},{"label":"Lecturers team","href":"/en/university/info/llm/administration/lecturers-team"},{"label":"Annual report","href":"/en/university/info/llm/administration/annual-report"},{"label":"LLM key figures","href":"/en/university/info/llm/administration/figures"},{"label":"Courses","href":"/en/university/info/llm/italian/courses"},{"label":"Lecturers","href":"/en/universita/info/llm/italiano/docenti"},{"label":"Courses satisfaction","href":"/en/university/info/llm/italian/satisfaction-italian-courses"},{"label":"FAQ","href":"https://www.desk.usi.ch/en/italian-language-courses-faq"},{"label":"Courses","href":"/en/university/info/llm/french/courses"},{"label":"Lecturers","href":"/en/university/info/llm/french/lecturers"},{"label":"Courses satisfaction","href":"/en/university/info/llm/french/satisfaction-french-courses"},{"label":"FAQ","href":"https://www.desk.usi.ch/en/french-language-courses-faq"},{"label":"Courses","href":"/en/university/info/llm/german/courses"},{"label":"Lecturers","href":"/en/university/info/llm/german/lecturers"},{"label":"Courses satisfaction","href":"/en/university/info/l